/* selectEmdCodeList Kwon.Min.Seo */ WITH /* isry.itgcm.bizcmmns.cmmns.EmdInqMapper.selectEmdCodeList(법정동코드 조회)*/ V_EMD_LIST AS (
), V_SGG_LIST AS (
), V_EMD_SGG_LIST AS ( SELECT T3.* FROM V_EMD_LIST T3 WHERE T3.CMMNS_CD_ID = #{CMMNS_CD_ID} UNION ALL SELECT T4.* FROM V_SGG_LIST T4 WHERE T4.CMMNS_CD_ID = #{CMMNS_CD_ID} ) SELECT T.SGG_CD /* 시군구코드 */ , T.CTPV_SE_CD /* 시도구분코드 */ , T.CTPV_NM /* 시도명 */ , T.ENG_CTPV_NM /* 영문시도명*/ , T.SGG_NM /* 시군구명 */ , T.STDG_CD /* 법정동코드 */ , T.STTY_EMD_NM /* 법정읍면동명 */ , T.DONG_NM /*행정동명*/ , T.DONG_CD /*행정동코드*/ FROM V_EMD_SGG_LIST T ORDER BY T.CTPV_SE_CD , T.STDG_CD
